        rdfs:comment "Cites Chindapol et al. (2013) PLoS Comput. Biol. with full authors, title, venue, and DOI (10.1371/journal.pcbi.1002849) and requires no external dataset files. Evidence: 2013-chindapol-coral-flow.py L5–L10: primary citation and DOI <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5659d5e/2013-chindapol-coral-flow.py#L5-L10>." ;
